+"""One-off / first-boot scripts (demo seeding, maintenance tasks).
+
+This package was referenced by app.main (SEED_ON_START=1) but missing from the
+repository, which crashed startup with ModuleNotFoundError. Restored as a
+safe stub: seeding is optional demo behaviour, so skipping is always valid.
+"""
